1026.description:
They say one misfortune is always followed by another. Well, this saying perfectly captures the plot of this action RPG. Mass Effect 2In the first installment of the series, the courageous Captain Shepard, supported by his valiant crew, fought the geth, who first attempted to seize a valuable artifact and then facilitated the resurrection of the Reapers, who were wiping out all life in the galaxy. Fortunately, the brave, strong, and intelligent warriors managed to defeat the geth.

And so, while finishing off the now-thin geth forces, Shepard is attacked by an unknown force. He soon discovers that the new enemy is a group of Collectors, who have previously remained silent and made virtually no contact with anyone. These Collectors are wiping out human colonies from the face of the Earth, apparently trying to cleanse it... Unsurprising, since their mentors are Reapers themselves. Well, Shepard must once again assemble a brave team and destroy these new pests!
Features Mass Effect 2 :
The sequel continues Shepard's story as he fights to preserve the human race. The geth have been defeated, but they're far from the only threat in the universe! This time, human warriors must defend their civilization from certain Collectors who are clearing the planet...
- Start playing Mass Effect 2 There are two ways to do this: by taking control of a "fresh" Shepard and developing him as the game progresses, or by teleporting your character from the first game, complete with all their skills and life circumstances. Each option is interesting in its own way.
The combat system has been significantly overhauled. The rules for shooting, injuring yourself, and using cover have been streamlined to force players to think tactically, be extremely careful, and carefully monitor their health bar.
As in the first game, Shepard will have a team of assistants that the player must assemble. A squad can consist of up to five soldiers, and choosing candidates wisely is crucial, as their skills and loyalty will determine the outcome of each mission. Team members can be upgraded depending on their level.
The developers have released numerous add-ons for the sequel, containing new quests, weapons, armor, and clothing. Overall, gamers find plenty of reasons to download them. Mass Effect 2 via torrent.

